  "releaseNotes": {
    "zh": [
      "每一種錶面組合都有自己的固件名稱（VTX-AG4IN1-C1～C4、碳纖版 C1CARBON），而且帶有版本號。之後更新頁面會依照這個名稱，自動找出你這台儀表的固件。",
      "移除了沒有用到的語音辨識元件，固件變小，功能不受影響。",
      "只更新程式（app）時，主題、單位、警示門檻等設定都會保留。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Each gauge combo now has its own firmware name (VTX-AG4IN1-C1 to C4, carbon C1CARBON) and a version number, so the update page can pick the right firmware for your gauge automatically.",
      "Removed the unused speech-recognition component; the firmware is smaller and nothing you use has changed.",
      "An app-only update keeps your settings (theme, units, warning thresholds)."
    ]
  }
